stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING: Order.create (order.placed)
  PENDING --> CONFIRMED: payment.succeeded → confirm() (order.confirmed)
  PENDING --> CANCELLED: payment.failed or stock.reservation_failed → cancel(reason) (order.cancelled)
  PENDING --> PAYMENT_FAILED: reserved, not used
  CONFIRMED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
